["```r\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)([dplyr](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org))\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)([ggplot2](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org))\n```", "```r\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)(dslabs)\n```", "```r\n[ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)(data = murders)\n```", "```r\nmurders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)()\n```", "```r\np <- [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)(data = murders)\n```", "```r\n[print](https://rdrr.io/r/base/print.html)(p)\np\n```", "```r\nmurders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)() + [geom_point](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_point.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(population/10^6, total))\n```", "```r\nmurders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)() + \n [geom_point](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_point.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(population/10^6, total)) +\n [geom_text](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_text.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(population/10^6, total, label = abb))\n```", "```r\nmurders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(population/10^6, total)) +\n [geom_point](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_point.html)() +\n [geom_text](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_text.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(label = abb))\n```", "```r\nmurders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(population/10^6, total)) +\n [geom_point](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_point.html)() +\n [geom_text](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_text.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(x = 10, y = 800, label = \"Hello there!\"))\n#> Warning in geom_text(aes(x = 10, y = 800, label = \"Hello there!\")): All aesthetics have length 1, but the data has 51 rows.\n#> ℹ Please consider using `annotate()` or provide this layer with data\n#>   containing a single row.\n```", "```r\nmurders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(population/10^6, total)) +\n [geom_point](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_point.html)(size = 3) +\n [geom_text](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_text.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(label = abb), nudge_x = 1.5)\n```", "```r\nmurders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(population/10^6, total)) +\n [geom_point](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_point.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(color = region), size = 3) \n```", "```r\nmurders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(population/10^6, total)) +\n [geom_point](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_point.html)(color = \"blue\", size = 3) \n```", "```r\np0 <- murders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(population/10^6, total))\n```", "```r\np1 <- p0 +  [geom_point](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_point.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(color = region), size = 3)\n```", "```r\np2 <- p1 + [geom_text](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_text.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(label = abb), nudge_x = 0.1)\n```", "```r\np3 <- p2 + [scale_x_log10](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/scale_continuous.html)() + [scale_y_log10](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/scale_continuous.html)() \np3\n```", "```r\np4 <- p3 + [labs](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/labs.html)(title = \"US Gun Murders in 2010\",\n x = \"Populations in millions (log scale)\", \n y = \"Total number of murders (log scale)\",\n color = \"Region\")\np4\n```", "```r\nr <- murders |> \n [summarize](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/reference/summarise.html)(rate = [sum](https://rdrr.io/r/base/sum.html)(total)/[sum](https://rdrr.io/r/base/sum.html)(population)*10^6) |> \n [pull](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/reference/pull.html)(rate)\n```", "```r\np5 <- p4 + \n [geom_abline](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_abline.html)(intercept = [log10](https://rdrr.io/r/base/Log.html)(r), lty = 2, color = \"darkgrey\") \np5\n```", "```r\n[ds_theme_set](https://rdrr.io/pkg/dslabs/man/ds_theme_set.html)()\n```", "```r\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)([ggthemes](https://jrnold.github.io/ggthemes/))\np6 <- p5 + [theme_economist](http://jrnold.github.io/ggthemes/reference/theme_economist.html)()\n```", "```r\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)([ggthemes](https://jrnold.github.io/ggthemes/))\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)([ggrepel](https://ggrepel.slowkow.com/))\n r <- murders |> \n [summarize](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/reference/summarise.html)(rate = [sum](https://rdrr.io/r/base/sum.html)(total) /  [sum](https://rdrr.io/r/base/sum.html)(population) * 10^6) |>\n [pull](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/reference/pull.html)(rate)\n murders |> \n [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(population/10^6, total)) + \n [geom_abline](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_abline.html)(intercept = [log10](https://rdrr.io/r/base/Log.html)(r), lty = 2, color = \"darkgrey\") +\n [geom_point](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_point.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(col = region), size = 3) +\n [geom_text_repel](https://ggrepel.slowkow.com/reference/geom_text_repel.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(label = abb)) + \n [scale_x_log10](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/scale_continuous.html)() +\n [scale_y_log10](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/scale_continuous.html)() +\n [labs](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/labs.html)(title = \"US Gun Murders in 2010\",\n x = \"Populations in millions (log scale)\", \n y = \"Total number of murders (log scale)\",\n color = \"Region\") +\n [theme_economist](http://jrnold.github.io/ggthemes/reference/theme_economist.html)()\n```", "```r\nmurders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(region)) + [geom_bar](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_bar.html)()\n```", "```r\ntab <- murders |> \n [count](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/reference/count.html)(region) |> \n [mutate](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/reference/mutate.html)(proportion = n/[sum](https://rdrr.io/r/base/sum.html)(n))\n```", "```r\ntab |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(region, proportion)) + [geom_col](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_bar.html)()\n```", "```r\nheights |> [filter](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/reference/filter.html)(sex == \"Female\") |> \n [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(height)) + \n [geom_histogram](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_histogram.html)(binwidth = 1, fill = \"blue\", col = \"black\")\n```", "```r\nheights |> \n [filter](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/reference/filter.html)(sex == \"Female\") |>\n [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(height)) +\n [geom_density](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_density.html)(fill = \"blue\")\n```", "```r\nheights |> \n [filter](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/reference/filter.html)(sex == \"Female\") |>\n [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(height)) +\n [geom_density](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_density.html)(fill=\"blue\", adjust = 2)\n```", "```r\nheights |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(sex, height)) +\n [geom_boxplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_boxplot.html)()\n```", "```r\nx <- [expand.grid](https://rdrr.io/r/base/expand.grid.html)(x = 1:12, y = 1:10) |> [mutate](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/reference/mutate.html)(z = 1:120) \n```", "```r\nx |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(x, y, fill = z)) + [geom_raster](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_tile.html)()\n```", "```r\nx |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(x, y, fill = z)) + \n [geom_raster](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_tile.html)() + \n [scale_fill_gradientn](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/scale_gradient.html)(colors =  [terrain.colors](https://rdrr.io/r/grDevices/palettes.html)(10, 1))\n```", "```r\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)(gridExtra)\n[grid.arrange](https://rdrr.io/pkg/gridExtra/man/arrangeGrob.html)(p5, p6, ncol = 2)\n```", "```r\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)([dplyr](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org))\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)([ggplot2](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org))\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)(dslabs)\n```", "```r\np <- [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)(data = murders)\n```", "```r\np <- [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)(murders)\n```", "```r\np <- murders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)()\n```", "```r\nmurders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(x = , y = )) +\n [geom_point](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_point.html)()\n```", "```r\nmurders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(population, total)) +\n [geom_point](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_point.html)()\n```", "```r\nmurders |> [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(population, total)) + [geom_label](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_text.html)()\n```", "```r\np <- murders |> \n [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(population, total, label = abb, color = region)) +\n [geom_label](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_text.html)() \n```", "```r\nheights |> \n [ggplot](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/ggplot.html)([aes](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/aes.html)(height, fill = sex)) + \n [geom_density](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_density.html)() \n```"]